{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "79d298d7-5550-533a-8ed9-02e2470c77a0", "source_ordinal": 603, "reading_ordinal": 3454, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "难得糊涂", "published_at": "2025-08-28T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/a62277347dfd11f0a56d52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "谈一个婚姻应有的状态。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我是一向主张“公私分界”的——即双方各自都有自己自留的部分收入、事业、朋友、财产，约定不参与家庭财产分配。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一部分纳入家庭共有部分，按家庭共有的逻辑处理；一部分仍然是自我保留，按自己个人的意愿处理。双方要协商的是共有部分的额度、规则，只要共有部分承担完毕，多的部分不问不理、自行处置。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你也许觉得这太“惊世骇俗”，但是客观上、实践上天然的就会慢慢变成这样。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人会很快学会有意无意的隐瞒收入、限制信息流动、隔绝人际圈子。以现在普遍“双职工”的家庭现状，这几乎是必然发生的事实。上述主张本质上只是将双方默默就会自己做的选择直接摆在了明处，有效的、自觉的管理起来了。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这跟本题有何关系？", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "关系在于这种“分级划界管理”的模式可以很好的克服亲密关系中的利益冲突问题。因为家庭公账和个人私账之间存在一道明确的防火墙，那么只要你确认你的私账上的留存足以保证你的财务安全，你就可以在公账事务上放松心态、慷慨大方。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "换言之，私账分明且由你自己完全个人掌控，这个账上每个月有足够的正现金流、足够支撑你可能的“离婚生活”，你就会因为这份底气而不会对家庭公共事务到底有多少有利于你、多少有利于对方斤斤计较。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "就算是全利于对方，一点都没有利于自己又如何？大不了当作那份支出就是家庭必要的支出，就是为了买一个家庭气氛该付的钱好了。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 563}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一旦你采用这个慷慨的态度，反而容易推动对方也采取相对慷慨的态度，更愿意在共同事务上考虑你的意愿和利益。", "char_start": 564, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "很简单嘛——慷慨的关系当然比吝啬的关系投资价值大。你让慷慨的人高兴，你自然不容易吃亏。而如果对方是吝啬的人，你让ta高兴，投入的成本很容易肉包子打狗，那当然善财难舍了。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 700}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而这就对照出传统家庭财务伦理的问题了——收入全部上交，完全纳入统筹，毫无自留财产，在家庭内部实施家庭共产主义。", "char_start": 701, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "于是对公账财务的利益公平性的争议就要在生存焦虑的刺激下随时处在红热状态。", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 793}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不是不想慷慨，而是慷慨的结果就是一步到位的身无分文、头无片瓦，万一我敬人一尺，人没有敬我一丈，甚至人觉得我敬得还不够，怎么办？", "char_start": 794, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这两种安排孰优孰劣，你自己掂量吧。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 875}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我们只说前者的正常状态——那就是渐渐的公账会变成一笔双方都懒得算的糊涂账，反正自己手里的自有资金是安全的就行了。具体公账上吃了什么亏，其实无所谓，我吃亏便宜不也是你占了吗？我本来就爱你，我吃亏让你得利，原本不就是这么安排的吗？", "char_start": 876, "char_end": 989}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "于是既然是一本糊涂账，处在这个状态的人是做不到一时激愤热血上头就抛出一本极为详细的“吃亏笔记”来控诉对方的。", "char_start": 990, "char_end": 1044}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "硬逼着说几条吃亏的例子，反而会瞠目结舌、毫无素材。", "char_start": 1045, "char_end": 1070}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "逼问双方，双方都对自己吃了哪些亏这个问题瞠目结舌不知回答什么，没有清单可列，活活一对老糊涂蛋，这就是最幸福的安排。", "char_start": 1071, "char_end": 1128}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "难得糊涂。", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1134}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中年不惑，这类型的婚姻应该如何往前?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“难得糊涂”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“谈一个婚姻应有的状态。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "谈一个婚姻应有的状态。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "43221da3-7d9a-5915-bd19-afe37c7c9560", "source_ordinal": 602, "reading_ordinal": 3455, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "依法强硬", "published_at": "2025-08-28T16:29:13.292000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1938266093358642391/answer/1944435825464053900"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个非常妙的策划，痛点抓得准，方案也很巧，虽然这很大概率是表演性质的，但红线踩得很稳。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "法律是可以这么用，也应该多这么用用的。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "怎么用？", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "heading", "index": 4, "text": "依法强硬。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "先把法律了解清楚，然后凭借法律给予的合法自由采取积极的强硬立场。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我拳头比你大、财力比你强，而且我精通法律，对特定领域的判例、解释、法规甚至相关部门的尺度风格有丰富的实践经验，所以我现在友善的建议你不要犯蠢，停止你现在的侵害企图。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我不是什么小白兔，哭着请你尊重我的合法权利。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我是有好生之德，不希望你成为我正当防卫的拳下亡魂。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我建议你不要幻想有什么偷袭机会，你是不是看见我后院的锁很好撬？", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你放心，那是因为后院有藏獒。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "或者以为你可以编排一点小材料泼点脏水？以为你搞什么小动作我没看见？", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你放心，我在等你传播量大到足以立案。到时候我把你挖出来直接把你送走。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "善良不是退让、委屈，而是提前告知你风险，免得你枉死。", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "温柔是在万伏高压线前面插一个“高压危险”的牌子。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不是指你摸上来不会碳化。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你看，警告牌上甚至用的是荧光颜料，很贵的好么？", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这还不够温柔啊？", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你们要记住，不存在什么“初犯不计较”。", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "“初犯不计较”那是立法水平低，别人第一次犯的时候你要么没有立法，要么立了却没有有效告知，坦率讲那叫不知者不为罪。", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "明确立法了、清晰告知了，初犯就要计较，初犯就是全量判罚。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "温柔不体现在ta犯了也不处罚上，而体现在告示字够大、条款够清晰严谨上。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 597}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这之后就不是温柔善良管的剧情了。", "char_start": 598, "char_end": 614}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "强硬跟温柔不矛盾。", "char_start": 615, "char_end": 624}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「白社会」大哥法内狂徒高律师为家暴受害者撑场面走红，如何看待这个现象？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“依法强硬”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个非常妙的策划，痛点抓得准，方案也很巧，虽然这很大概率是表演性质的，但红线踩得很稳。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个非常妙的策划，痛点抓得准，方案也很巧，虽然这很大概率是表演性质的，但红线踩得很稳。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "728b87df-4496-5365-bb3e-ad955102c0ba", "source_ordinal": 601, "reading_ordinal": 3456, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "以彼之名", "published_at": "2025-08-29T00:18:10.573000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1943430407182845212/answer/1944485879608484384"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "最显然的一条——没用名字给企业命名。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "就这一条就已经说明了很多。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果你仔细观察，会发现在中国拿名字做商标的都是很市井的东西——张记炒货、老王烧饼、张小泉剪刀这类。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "高价值商品标的都是荣宝斋、一得阁、同仁堂这类名字——这是以产业为品牌担保。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而即使用人名来命名，用的也是代表家族的姓氏，而不是代表个人的名。因为只有一个家族才能担保一个品牌，一个人只能压住一款产品，是压不住一整个品牌的。", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不信做个实验——按照小鹏汽车的命名逻辑，本田汽车应该叫“宗一郎汽车”，丰田要改名“喜一郎汽车”，“奔驰汽车”要改名“卡尔汽车”。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "“宗一郎汽车”“喜一郎汽车”“卡尔汽车”，有没有觉得突然味道就变了？", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你没觉得这是拉面、果冻、香肠的名字吗？", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "某种角度上讲，这其实是几千年传承下来的普遍文化传统，甚至是不分东西、跨文化的普遍人类学现象。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而这两位创始人显然要么是对此没有直觉，要么就是没有敬畏。他们滥用了自己的创始人特权，于是就因为这份傲慢诅咒了自己的品牌。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这份代价是永无穷尽的，是技术先进、宣传预算永远扭转不了的——想扭转整个人类的心理条件反射，只花个几百亿美元就能办到？", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "移山易，移人心难。", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "何小鹏终有疾病、衰老、受伤、失能的一天，小鹏汽车终有易手的一日，那时候谁来接“小鹏汽车”的招牌？一个刚好叫王小鹏的买家吗？", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "还是说花五百亿美元买下来，第一件事先改个名？", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 575}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：同为新势力车企掌舵人，李斌和李想、何小鹏比，最大区别在哪？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“以彼之名”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“最显然的一条——没用名字给企业命名。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "最显然的一条——没用名字给企业命名。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1de3d1f9-c5ac-5e35-aabf-599e8fa73ef0", "source_ordinal": 600, "reading_ordinal": 3457, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "鸡与猴", "published_at": "2025-08-29T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/e24e50da7ec911f0a0d852540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一个最简单的判定依据——ta有没有对你“背人批评，当人表扬”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "背着人，单独批评你，无论怎么批评，都不会影响你的社会风评，这就是一种爱护。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "尤其是单独说批评的话，你一个怀恨在心，几时当着别的同事的面喊出来“你那天晚上明明跟我说xxx”，ta就会被你出卖。你以为同事们会同情你挨批评、“被PUA”？", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你错了，ta们会怨恨领导给了你一个人特殊的指点，让你得到了特殊的、ta们所没有的优势，ta们会暗暗解恨——为领导遭遇的你的背叛，因为这在ta们看来恰恰就是领导偏爱错了人的报应。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个你不懂，但是单独私下批评你的领导是非常清楚的。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "没有偏爱的领导要批评你最多就是语气柔和点，而且批评一定当着别人，一定有堂皇正当的事由，批评的都是你干得不像人事、骂你好让别人知道这是干不得的事。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "说白了，是拿你当鸡杀给猴子看。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而且是明正典刑，大家拍手称快——早就看你干得稀烂不像话，大家早就不耐烦甚至怀疑领导包庇了。这时候领导出手杀鸡，一来可以向下属证明自己还是很宽容的，不到这个地步的失误都不会惩罚，二来可以证明自己大公无私，杀鸡的刀不是拿不住，小猴崽子们不要妄想真的可以无法无天。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而一旦领导选了私下批评，就等于把后背交给你了，给了你攀扯、出卖的把柄。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta本来不必这么选的。你记住，ta本来不需要冒这个险的。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "再看“当人表扬”。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "ta当着别人——注意这是指外人，比如别的公司、别的单位的人——表扬你，就等于在这个人面前给你做了担保。不仅仅是对当时夸奖的具体技能、成就做了担保，而且同时为你的信用、人品做了担保。你在这个见证者眼里就从此成了“被xx领导看重的人”，你在这个人面前说话办事，这人就要考虑你领导的面子。ta就会认为帮你一把就等于卖你的领导一个人情，如果阻碍你、得罪你，就是在驳你领导的面子。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 745}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而这就意味着领导在赌你不会狐假虎威、胡作非为。", "char_start": 746, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你记不记得鲁达怎么欺负郑屠？他打着小种经略相公的旗号说小种相公家里要做菜，要郑屠办事。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "郑屠会去找小种相公核实吗？如果他真的跑去核实一次，被鲁达发现了就会深深的得罪鲁达。就算揭穿了鲁达，鲁达可能不过是挨一顿骂，但是小种相公身边的军官岂是可以白得罪的？你不怕他几时逮住机会“发挥关键作用”搞到你破家灭门？", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 921}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "所以郑屠能核实吗？", "char_start": 922, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而这需要啥？只需要小种相公当着别人的面半骂半夸一句“鲁达这厮倒算得用”，用不了三五天就传遍州城，人人就都知道鲁达是司令长官的“得用之人”，你就已经可以凭着这点白打郑屠一顿。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "鲁达是手重冲动打死了人，否则你信不信只是打得郑屠卧床三月，郑屠何止不敢报复，还要伤好之后客客气气来请教“小人不知如何恶了提辖”，要赔礼、要请罪、要指点呢。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1096}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以久经江湖的领导绝不会轻易的当着外人的面夸下属，因为这道祝福发出去，如果被夸的人是个惹祸精，麻烦手尾天知道有多大？", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1155}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "ta如果这么夸你，ta也是在你身上下了大注，而且冒了很大的风险。", "char_start": 1156, "char_end": 1188}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "ta本来可以不这么做的。", "char_start": 1189, "char_end": 1201}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "遗憾的是，很多小孩子只会觉得挨了批评不舒服，得了夸奖该当的。", "char_start": 1202, "char_end": 1232}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "所以这两条其实是连环计——如果ta发现私下批评你，你的反应不太健康，那么ta以后就不再私下批评你了，改公开批评你了——一顶小鸡帽给你戴上，猴子们兴奋得吱哇乱叫。", "char_start": 1233, "char_end": 1313}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "更不必提什么“当人表扬”了。", "char_start": 1314, "char_end": 1328}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "自己想想吧。", "char_start": 1329, "char_end": 1335}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么判定领导有没有把你当自己人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“鸡与猴”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一个最简单的判定依据——ta有没有对你“背人批评，当人表扬”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一个最简单的判定依据——ta有没有对你“背人批评，当人表扬”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1e36927e-4fb1-5ef2-aaf4-9ec07bba1870", "source_ordinal": 599, "reading_ordinal": 3458, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "出格", "published_at": "2025-08-30T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/2661311a7f9d11f082405254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这主要是指你做了一些出头亮相的事。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如在会议中发言，导致ta认为你这个发言可能会被老板、客户注意到。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "比如在讨论方案的时候，你抱着一种“我可以解决问题”的态度提出建议。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如在需要人举手领命的时候，你不学别人低头装死等头头来点将而是主动请缨。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你在争夺建立功勋的机会，或者你不避讳被人妒忌、忌讳的风险，你就会被评为“高调”。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个“高调论”背后有上下两个层面的合谋。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "下层有一种互相团结对抗管理层的隐形文化，靠的是彼此心照不宣的消极来和“穿长衫的”对抗。所以ta们对你这种“向长衫追求认可”的行为就会本能的反感。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而高层则喜欢“有序积极”——ta们不是不喜欢积极，而是不喜欢失控感。例如你没有经过老板的许可突然在客户会议上直接建议某个方案，这就会展现出一种公司管理失序的迹象，对公司品牌造成损害。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta们的这些行为是否正当、正义，这是另一个问题，但这是普遍会有的本能情绪，这一点是毋庸置疑的。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "自己想想怎么避免吧。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 408}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：刚入职场，总是被同事说「很高调」，这是什么意思？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“出格”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这主要是指你做了一些出头亮相的事。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这主要是指你做了一些出头亮相的事。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cd2d66b0-c4c9-57a2-b9ba-9c54bcf23f69", "source_ordinal": 598, "reading_ordinal": 3459, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "untouchable", "published_at": "2025-08-30T15:59:14.088000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1944762306467730462/answer/1945150248923162614"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "小米需要思考一个更根本的问题——从不败诉是不是对自己真的有利？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这话听起来荒唐——输官司怎么可能有利？当然是赢官司有利。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但问题是，当你的人财势力大到一定程度，面对实力远不如你的原告，你输不输的确几乎就是一个投入多少资源的技术性问题。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一个取决于你的选择的问题。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为至不济还有私下巨额赔偿加NDA协议这一招——事已至此，是选现得200万还是选择赌自己打得过预算几亿的法务团队、拿到不如和解金的法定赔偿并在米粉的仇恨中身败名裂？有几个人会选择后者？", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以，技术上讲，一家巨头企业只要想不败诉，基本就可以心想事成。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "现在的问题是，你是可以，但这样选对你真的更好吗？", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "当消费者发现你“在法律上不可战胜”，ta们就要把你所有的承诺都视为一种微妙的实际无效。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果这件产品无关乎生死，那么我可以指望拿到你的和解金，那么我的诉讼策略就是尽量闹大，以求获得最大的赔偿金额，因为我知道你常胜成瘾，这张NDA协议我卖得可贵。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "然而如果这件产品关系到生死呢？", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我需要我死亡的风险对你们成为不可控的风险，而不是一个“最多五百万的NDA”。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为以你们的体量，后者约等于0。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只有我的死亡对你们必然是一个足够相称的风险，我才能真的相信你们在预防这风险上的努力，这是一个非常朴素而直白的道理。", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不可战胜，从不败诉，是没有资格卖关系到生死的产品的。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不要把卖电视机的习惯拿来卖汽车。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "仔细想好，慎重选择——这说的不只是小米。", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "在将来，那些接受官司上法庭、接受败诉、承受赔偿的企业会比那些从不败诉的企业更得已经成熟的用户的信任，以至于“输过赔过”会是一道门槛。", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "是的，你们可以选择“从不败诉”，但你们该不该这样选择？", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我说的是你们，各位老总们，因为你们的法务部是绝不可能自己去选“败诉也不是坏事”的。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "是你们要选。", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "Is untouchable really acceptable?", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 777}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待200多名准车主集体诉讼小米YU7要求退还定金的事件？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“untouchable”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“小米需要思考一个更根本的问题——从不败诉是不是对自己真的有利？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "小米需要思考一个更根本的问题——从不败诉是不是对自己真的有利？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f62b8645-6e57-5158-9b78-8b785241c7a1", "source_ordinal": 597, "reading_ordinal": 3460, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "云师采药去", "published_at": "2025-08-31T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/0c5c16fc804e11f094da52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "懂事就是“听话”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "说这种话的人就不懂事。如果ta小时候被父母夸过懂事，那就意味着ta的父母也并不知道懂事到底是指什么。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "懂事，是指因为理解社会运行的规则而善于选择明智的博弈策略，而这种明智常常体现为对父母恰当的服从。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "懂事要害在懂。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta是睁着眼睛、通过权衡长期的总体利弊得失和短期利益，选择了一个高水平的策略。是这个策略里流露出的高水准慑服了观众，才令人拍案叫绝、抚掌赞叹。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta的回话、处置，一看措辞分寸，就知道ta是懂的。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "拒绝，就拒绝得人无法再侥幸、又没有产生愤恨幽怨；接受，就接受得对方既感到欣慰、愉快，又无法生出颠倒妄想。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "谦而不卑，和而不同，绵里藏针，攻守兼备。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是一种社会性摔跤运动，懂事的人只一个站架，就会让你发现下盘稳固、防守周全而蓄势待发。一看ta就是懂的。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这绝不等于“绝对服从”，恰恰相反，它常常体现为圆滑玲珑的拒绝。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "父母被拒绝了却觉得言之有理，毫无被挑衅的情绪，也没有对子女的服从性发生怀疑，这时候ta们——以及旁观者——才会由衷的赞叹你懂事。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "当然，很清楚读书学习的重要性而知道自觉的读书也是懂事的表现之一。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但再说一遍——懂事不等于“无条件听话”。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要懂事，事事留心是不可免的，但也一定要同时多读历史、学好语文。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为当你做出某个明确的应对之后，人很可能要在佩服完之后问你怎么想到要这样应对。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 565}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "是你娓娓道来的这份周密深刻的决策过程才真正的证明你是懂而不是凑巧。", "char_start": 566, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "“你为什么对张叔说帮他转告诉求而不是直接告诉他我在小区门口吃饭？”", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "“因为我不确定他找你什么事，而你是否对他这个请求有心理准备。无论如何我帮他转告都比我直接送他来找你对你更从容。”", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "“你又为什么要让他写条子而不是直接问他是什么事？”", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "“因为我是个小孩，恐怕记错事，也担心他的所请我并不宜知道，所以我给了个信封他写了我直接转交。”", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这种表现，就算是被拒绝的张叔听了也不免要对你父母道一声喜——这娃前途无量。", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "看懂没有？这才叫懂事。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这些真懂事的小孩长大了变成“老黄牛+情绪垃圾桶”的概率不能说是零，但ta们绝不可能是这么容易被人欺骗操纵的蠢才。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 872}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：从小被夸“懂事”的孩子，长大后发现自己成了“老黄牛+情绪垃圾桶”，这是中国式教育的普遍陷阱吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“云师采药去”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“懂事就是“听话”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "懂事就是“听话”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "646df58c-b155-5563-8646-c7d5dae28529", "source_ordinal": 596, "reading_ordinal": 3461, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "战而后胜", "published_at": "2025-08-31T17:03:21.275000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/39261295/answer/1945530289108526198"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你需要一套覆盖面完整的题，然后在题的引导下去看书。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "本质上这是“身经百战，然后去上军校”。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "做题的时候你有大量的解题技巧可以跳着高取胜，例如你其实不知道正确答案是啥，只是你发现其他三项都是错的，所以你猜到了正确的那一项。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "又或者你因为做过太多题，对题干描述产生了直觉，猜到了出题人的意图，所以在不知道确切答案的前提下猜到了答案。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 164}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这都属于“街头智慧”，没学过拳法，靠街头实战的奇招巧招都打赢了。就像抗日义勇军没受过什么正规训练，靠着临场的智慧、听说书听来的战略战术打赢了不少伏击战、遭遇战。", "char_start": 165, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "打完了要复盘，要知道“后怕”。别看你赢了，你要知道很多题你是捡了一条命。你要多想“幸亏出题人不是我，是我的话我在这里拐个小弯、在那里改一下干扰项，恐怕我就死了”。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你要回头去看书、去求教，消除掉自己的这些后怕、侥幸。回头再去面对这类挑战，你就会更自信。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "现在问题来了，为什么不反过来，先把教科书读得滚瓜烂熟再去做题呢？", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为这样安排和人的心理规律有冲突。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你是烂命一条冲进敌阵里拿把西瓜刀乱砍，砍倒了两个还全身而退，你会觉得你是一个赢家。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你是名门少侠苦练八年七剑下天山，结果被西瓜摊主拿扁担敲中脑袋，你会觉得你是个输家。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "前者是以后怕的赢家身份带着恐惧这一强大的驱动力去学习保命符。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "后者是以沮丧的输家身份带着质疑去怨恨师傅教的东西没用。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人家输了知道要去重温教科书、重建基本概念去提高。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 592}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你本来已经把教科书读得滚瓜烂熟了，老师已经交口称赞了，你还犯各种低级错误，你接下来要怎么改进？老师们给你的反馈多半是“其实你都懂，你只是要收起怠慢心，要学会认真仔细”。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 677}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "后者给你的是挫折感，是对自己天赋和运气本身的怀疑。", "char_start": 678, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而那些战斗英雄们呢？我打烂仗都可以活下来还可以杀几个鬼子，我现在又学会了开坦克车、用狙击枪，我一定可以创造更大的战场奇迹。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "ta是越打自信越强的。", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 777}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以我一向强调尽早参加实战，尽早见血，用战场经验教训来指引阶段性的理论学习。只不过你要注意几条：", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "1）实战要符合你自己的段位，只能向上跳一级。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 849}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "要去打那些你跳起来能摸到桃子屁股，没准还能揪下几个的仗。显然你不能四则运算还没学明白就去搭核反应堆。那样你只会输都不知道怎么输的，你也不知道这些失败可以靠补强什么知识去解决，这就属于没有意义的失败。", "char_start": 850, "char_end": 949}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "2）要多打、大打。", "char_start": 950, "char_end": 959}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "以战代学是逆向摸索知识树，好处是每次摸索成果都很牢固，但坏处却是如果你打得少，你很可能摸不全整棵知识树。所以你不能打了两场结果还行就算了，你得多打、大打，靠概率减少漏点、盲点。", "char_start": 960, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "3）要有战略性。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "什么时候打、打什么仗，你要有一个战略规划，不要总打遭遇战，而要打伏击战、运动战。有意识的、有策略的、地毯式的打通关。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1116}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "打到最后你会养成一种盲目的自信：", "char_start": 1117, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "未胜者亦可胜，已胜者必再胜。", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1148}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这种没有确切根据，但是却有无穷经验可以担保的勇气是人生巨大的财富。", "char_start": 1149, "char_end": 1182}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "因为它可以根绝抑郁。", "char_start": 1183, "char_end": 1193}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0496"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：看书与刷题哪一个对考试更重要？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“战而后胜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你需要一套覆盖面完整的题，然后在题的引导下去看书。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你需要一套覆盖面完整的题，然后在题的引导下去看书。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
